== Walkthrough ==

This quest begins with [[Qarrgy Scallopgobbler]] on the beach of Cobalt Scar. He is an otter located at -800, -400.

'''Bring him the following items in exchange for a [[Sea Dragonscale Bracer]]:'''

;{{box}} [[Ornately Runed Shell Necklace]] (rare drop from neriad weavers in Siren's Grotto)
;{{box}} [[Sea Dragon Scales]] (dropped by Kelorek`Dar)
;{{box}} [[Fine Plate Bracer]] (168 trivial blacksmith combine)

You say, 'Hail, Qarrgy Scallopgobbler'

: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler sets down several large crustacean shells covered in foreign runes, then extends his large, coarse hands in a gesture of friendship.
: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler says, 'I am pleased to see friendly visitors to our villages. I am the head craftsman of the village. The crustacean shell armor worn by the warriors of our village was crafted by me and by my apprentices. I will craft other materials as well when they are available.'

You say, 'What other materials?'

: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler says, 'I am able to craft dragon scale armor but it has been a long time since I have had the opportunity to do so for my people. What kind of scales do you wish for me to craft?'

You say, 'Sea Dragon Scales'

: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler says, 'Should you slay Kelorek'Dar, the sea dragon, I would craft you a sea dragon bracer from his scales. All I ask for are the scales of the dragon, an ornately runed shell necklace, and an unstained bracer crafted of the metal you strange ones call fine steel.'

: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler regards you indifferently -- it appears to be quite formidable.

: Qarrgy Scallopgobbler skillfully crafts the Sea Dragon Scales into a bracer than hands it to Gweed and claps enthusiastically.

